### Additional information

| Pattern | Result |
|---------|--------|
| `{[].map(...)}` `<input/>` | ✅ works |
| `{["a"].map(...)}` `{[].map(...)}` | ✅ works |
| `{[].map(...)}` `{[].map(...)}` | ❌ crashes |
