The error happens in the `build()` function's child-flattening loop in `src/jsx/dom/render.ts`:

```typescript
for (let i = 0; i < children.length; i++) {
  if (Array.isArray(children[i])) {
    children.splice(i, 1, ...(children[i] as Child[]).flat())
  }
  let child = buildNode(children[i])
```

**Suggested fix:**

Add `i--` after splicing so the loop re-examines the same index:

```typescript
for (let i = 0; i < children.length; i++) {
  if (Array.isArray(children[i])) {
    children.splice(i, 1, ...(children[i] as Child[]).flat())
+   if (i >= children.length) break  // empty array removed, nothing replaced
+   i--  // re-examine this index
+   continue
  }
  let child = buildNode(children[i])
```

